    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Regimens\" title=\"Force Regimens\">Force Regimens</a></i> </p><p>You hone your skill at deflecting blaster bolts using your&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>. This Force Regimen is performed blind, often with the help of a helmet equipped with an opaque blast shield. </p><p><b>Time:</b> 1 Hour </p><p><b>Targets:</b> Self </p><p><b>Requirements:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BCA-11/X_Training_Droid\" title=\"BCA-11/X Training Droid\">BCA-11/X Training Droid</a>, and a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blinding_Helmet\" title=\"Blinding Helmet\">Blinding Helmet</a>. </p><p><b>Make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check.</b> The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen: </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DC </th> \n   <th> </th> \n   <th>EFFECT </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>18-22 </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>You hone your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> skills, but the training remote gets several hits on you. You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to add to the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check made to activate the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a> </b>Talent. This does not count toward the \"one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> per round\" limit. </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>23-27 </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>You hone your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> skills, and the remote gets in a few small hits on you. You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to add to the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check made to activate the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a> </b>Talent. This does not count toward the \"one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> per round\" limit. You also gain 1 temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>, which can only be used to add to the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check made to activate the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a> </b>Talent. </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>28+ </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>You hone your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> skills, and the remote never harms you. You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to add to the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check made to activate the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b> Talent. This does not count toward the \"one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> per round\" limit. You also gain 2 temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a>, which can only be used to add to the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check made to activate the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a> </b>Talent. </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
